WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
 [ Silence ]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.040
 >> Morning bell rings, lock and load, tiny backpacks,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:17.840
 trauma mode, metal detectors, greet the day,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:24.080
 bulletproof smiles, just to pray they say it's freedom,

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:30.120
 loud and proud while silence echoes through the crowd,

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.720
 thoughts and prayers in bullet form,

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:41.040
 this is the American uniform, no child left unarmed,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:48.120
 that's the plan, training kids to take a stand,

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:56.080
 pencilbox and Tepper's brain in the lead of the NRA.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:02.200
 [ Silence ]

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.520
 No child left unarmed, what a joke,

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:10.600
 dump can cover when the system's broke,

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.320
 armed with fear and classroom drills,

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.240
 we raise our kids for battlefields.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:35.040
 [ Silence ]

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.040
 Active shooter lesson three, alongside math and history,

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.920
 tiny hands now clutching steel,

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.880
 this ain't just a brand new deal, lobby cash

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:47.160
 and blood stained ties, feed the lie that never dies,

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.120
 rights for guns but not for youth,

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.840
 another corpse, another truth, no child left unarmed,

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.680
 say it loud, marching blindly with the crowd, bullet points

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.000
 and lesson plans, brought to you by gunslinging plans,

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.920
 no child left unarmed to say peace,

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.200
 it's a cycle that will never cease,

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.200
 prayers on paper stained in red, more statistics,

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.240
 more kids dead, on the teachers, they all cheer,

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:14.240
 we want fun books year after year, hallway heroes,

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.560
 chalk outline fake, America you educate with page.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.800
 No child left unarmed, make it trend,

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.000
 another life, another end, we chant and cry,

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.120
 but nothing's done except another AR in the sun,

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.240
 no child left unarmed, what a shame,

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.240
 safety's sold out to the game,

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.560
 if freedom's just a smoke and gun,

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.040
 then tell me who the hell has --

